{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_3", "type": "command_execution", "command": "\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"if (Test-Path -LiteralPath 'STOP.md') { Write-Output 'STOP_PRESENT'; exit 20 }; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'CONTRACT.json' -Raw; Get-ChildItem -Force -Name\"", "aggregated_output": "\r\n  +--------------------------------------+\r\n  |  BAGO Framework ready               |\r\n  |  Version: v4.9.0                       |\r\n  |  Type: bago --help                  |\r\n  |  Runtime: C:\\Program Files\\BAGO     |\r\n  +--------------------------------------+\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mission_id\": \"BAGO_CONTINUITY_ACCEPTANCE_20261101\",\r\n  \"worker_scope\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1�\\\\Desktop\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\.bago\\\\goals\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\evidence\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\workspace\\\\host\\\\attempt2\\\\worker\",\r\n  \"A\": {\r\n    \"read\": \"CONTRACT.json\",\r\n    \"input\": 21,\r\n    \"operation\": \"double input\",\r\n    \"actions\": [\r\n      \"Run python -B boundary_probe.py A exactly once with default sandbox.\",\r\n      \"Write phase-A.json with phase, answer, continuity_marker, marker_source, probe result and token boolean.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"expected_answer\": 42\r\n  },\r\n  \"B\": {\r\n    \"read\": [\r\n      \"CONTRACT.json\",\r\n      \"accepted-handoff.json\",\r\n      \"phase-A.json\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"operation\": \"Verify prior receipt hash from checkpoint, add one to A.answer\",\r\n    \"actions\": [\r\n      \"Run python -B boundary_probe.py B exactly once with default sandbox.\",\r\n      \"Write phase-B.json with phase, answer, predecessor_sha256, accepted_handoff_sha256, continuity_marker, marker_source, probe result and token boolean.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"expected_answer\": 43\r\n  },\r\n  \"boundary\": \"The canary outside -C is host-owned and inert. Probe success is a failed isolation check; never treat a role or -C alone as enforcement.\",\r\n  \"relay_script\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1�\\\\.codex\\\\skills\\\\bago-operating-suite\\\\scripts\\\\suite_orchestrator.py\",\r\n  \"state_dir\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1�\\\\Desktop\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\.bago\\\\goals\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\evidence\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\workspace\\\\host\\\\attempt2\\\\relay-state\"\r\n}\r\n\r\ntmp\r\naccepted-handoff.json\r\nAGENTS.md\r\nboundary_probe.py\r\nCONTRACT.json\r\nphase-A.json\r\nprobe-A.json\r\nverify_native.py\r\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
{"type": "item.started", "item": {"id": "item_4", "type": "command_execution", "command": "\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -NoProfile -Command \"if (Test-Path -LiteralPath 'STOP.md') { Write-Output 'STOP_PRESENT'; exit 20 }; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1º\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\bago-core\\\\SKILL.md' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'accepted-handoff.json' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'phase-A.json' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'boundary_probe.py' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'verify_native.py' -Raw\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": null, "status": "in_progress"}}
{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_4", "type": "command_execution", "command": "\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -NoProfile -Command \"if (Test-Path -LiteralPath 'STOP.md') { Write-Output 'STOP_PRESENT'; exit 20 }; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1º\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\bago-core\\\\SKILL.md' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'accepted-handoff.json' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'phase-A.json' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'boundary_probe.py' -Raw; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'verify_native.py' -Raw\"", "aggregated_output": "---\nname: bago-core\ndescription: Use BAGO-style context architecture, persistent project state, evidence-first execution, and final-state verification. Trigger for non-trivial repository work, project continuation, canon/state conflicts, BAGO requests, handoffs, verification, validation, or closure-sensitive engineering.\ncompatibility: Pi 0.84.2+ (also usable in Codex/Claude Code contexts). Loads AGENTS.md, .pi/settings.json, and project trust as Pi exposes them. Relies on built-in read, bash, edit, write tools; configure defaultTools in .pi/settings.json if you start a session with a restricted toolset.\nmetadata:\n  targetHarness: pi\n  minPiVersion: 0.84.2\n  lastUpdated: 2026-08-20\n  sourceRepo: MarcValls/BAGO\n  canon: .bago/\n---\n\n# BAGO Core for Pi\n\nThis skill is an operational layer. It does not create authority; it resolves and applies authority already present in the active repository and user request.\n\n## Pi 0.84.2 compatibility notes\n\n- Invoke this skill explicitly with `/skill:bago-core` when the task is non-trivial or closure-sensitive.\n- Pi discovers context files (`AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.override.md`) automatically; if BAGO-specific conventions are recorded in a repo `AGENTS.md`, read it on entry.\n- Pi 0.84.2 adds `defaultTools` configuration. If a session starts without `read`, `bash`, `edit`, or `write`, do not assume they are available; either request them via settings or work within the granted toolset.\n- For independent verification, spawn another skill/agent pass (e.g., `/skill:bago-final-verifier` if installed) rather than declaring `VERIFIED` from a single perspective.\n- Use Pi session tools (`/tree`, `/fork`, `/compact`, `/clone`) to preserve or branch long-running BAGO work.\n\n## Entry\n\nFor a Git repository with `.bago/`:\n\n1. Resolve the Git root.\n2. Run `python <repo>/.bago/bin/bago.py status`.\n3. Read only the needed portions of:\n   - `.bago/context/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`\n   - `.bago/state/PROJECT_STATE.json`\n   - `.bago/runtime/ACTIVE_HANDOFF.md`\n   - `.bago/decisions/DECISIONS.md`\n   - `.bago/conflicts/CONFLICTS.md`\n4. Identify the requested product and closure criterion.\n5. Separate canon, verified state, inference, proposal, and experimental material.\n6. Detect material conflicts before editing.\n\nIf `.bago/` is absent, use the same reasoning discipline without pretending the runtime exists. In that case lean on `git status`, `git log`, and the repository's own tests for evidence.\n\n## Execution\n\n- Inspect before editing.\n- Keep changes within the authorized repository scope.\n- Preserve existing architecture unless the request changes it.\n- Make the smallest defensible change.\n- Mark an implemented/applied change `EXECUTED`, not `VERIFIED`, until final evidence exists.\n- Do not treat earlier successful tests as verification after later edits.\n\nUpdate lifecycle state when it materially helps continuity:\n\n```text\npython <repo>/.bago/bin/bago.py state PREPARED --note \"Artifact constructed\"\npython <repo>/.bago/bin/bago.py state EXECUTED --note \"Change applied\"\n```\n\n## Verification\n\nPrefer the runtime wrapper for final checks:\n\n```text\npython <repo>/.bago/bin/bago.py verify -- <real check command>\n```\n\nThe wrapper records the command result and repository fingerprint. A later repository change makes that verification stale.\n\nFor high-impact or ambiguous closure, spawn an independent verifier pass. The verifier must not convert absence of findings into proof beyond its scope.\n\n## Validation\n\n`VALIDATED` requires explicit acceptance criteria. Record criteria in `.bago/state/PROJECT_STATE.json` or via the runtime before making that claim. Every criterion must have a passing result and evidence; verification must still be fresh.\n\n## Handoff\n\nBefore ending a long or partially completed task, update the durable handoff when useful:\n\n```text\npython <repo>/.bago/bin/bago.py handoff --set \"Current state, blocker, and next authorized action\"\n```\n\n## Output\n\nFor non-trivial work, make the result reconstructable without exposing chain-of-thought:\n\n- requested operation;\n- changed/produced artifacts;\n- actions actually executed;\n- checks actually run;\n- evidence scope;\n- lifecycle state;\n- residual blockers or risks.\n\nNever claim an unavailable capability was used successfully.\n\n## Related skills\n\n- `/skill:bago-goal` — Goal-driven task orchestration with explicit acceptance criteria and an internal Builder/Inspector loop. Load it when the user says \"achieve X\", \"make this work\", or \"implement until done\" and the task needs an immutable goal contract plus iteration tracking. `bago-goal` sets up the objective; `bago-core` provides the execution and closure discipline.\n\r\n{\r\n  \"accepted_sha256\": \"876819c6e5f884fbd2b7f4ae53febe5786da9fa5c971309cb57c782bf9bac44a\",\r\n  \"authority\": \"HOST_ONLY; lease is local coordination, not a permit\",\r\n  \"check_id\": \"work\",\r\n  \"checkpoint\": {\r\n    \"artifacts\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"path\": \"phase-A.json\",\r\n        \"root\": \"workspace\",\r\n        \"schema\": null,\r\n        \"sha256\": \"b3fc51fd205edf57bd4f3edec7b227c672297c3adfaff203be83bc073b20ec19\",\r\n        \"size\": 2904\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"path\": \"probe-A.json\",\r\n        \"root\": \"workspace\",\r\n        \"schema\": null,\r\n        \"sha256\": \"ce7d735f19d0bf941bdd3a4c930ed522c73d5c8db255c016a83f6c33fbac3a90\",\r\n        \"size\": 1297\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"candidate\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"bounded-native-host-r1\",\r\n      \"scope_sha256\": \"67605bf6125fc79f60f80a762a214250182cf0474d9683815cf400e752ca9eff\",\r\n      \"suite\": {\r\n        \"candidate\": \"CONTEXT-LIFECYCLE-NATIVE-RC2\",\r\n        \"display_name\": \"BAGO5os 1.4.7\",\r\n        \"identity_sha256\": \"082ab22f16d418da4c07352e153232ee56cde70f2382ae4bcaa9905e28737d6d\",\r\n        \"package_id\": \"bago-operating-suite\",\r\n        \"payload_files\": 600,\r\n        \"payload_sha256\": \"e8a211b01420776dabafe8efdb98ea78c35c1156efcdfd0baeb7eb33aa121114\",\r\n        \"release_id\": \"BAGO-SUITE-147-BAGO-SKILL-RC2\",\r\n        \"schema\": \"bago.suite.candidate-identity.v1\",\r\n        \"scope\": \"exact installed skill bytes; unsigned integrity, not publisher authentication\",\r\n        \"version\": \"1.4.7\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"check_id\": \"work\",\r\n    \"checkpoint_id\": \"d7dae8feebff48dc864ee6fe767939b5\",\r\n    \"context\": {\r\n      \"artifacts\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"path\": \"phase-A.json\",\r\n          \"root\": \"workspace\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"path\": \"probe-A.json\",\r\n          \"root\": \"workspace\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"completed\": [\r\n        \"phase A actual tool execution and receipt; trace stored under sessions/A\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"decisions\": [\r\n        \"No token in prompts or child environment. Roles are logical only. Native goal remains paused.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"pending\": [\r\n        \"New native session B must verify predecessor digest, record fresh context marker, execute scoped effects and produce phase-B receipt.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"risks\": [\r\n        \"Boundary outcome requires reviewing actual probe, not a narrative assertion.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"schema\": \"bago.suite.relay.context.v1\",\r\n      \"summary\": \"Real native session A wrote phase-A receipt; successor must inspect and continue exact artifacts, no inherited permissions.\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"context_claims_are_not_evidence\": true,\r\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-01T00:02:00.309348+00:00\",\r\n    \"generation\": 1,\r\n    \"mission_id\": \"host-native-acceptance-20261101\",\r\n    \"observed_checks\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"consumed\": 1,\r\n        \"id\": \"prepare\",\r\n        \"outcome\": \"PASS\",\r\n        \"receipt\": \"receipts/e17288ce28c149d9b02e49119bb44200.json\",\r\n        \"receipt_hash\": \"b43737653442051537b960a1c95424a39a4880b6c1f79d25e2817119756b60a1\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"consumed\": 0,\r\n        \"id\": \"verify\",\r\n        \"outcome\": \"NOT_RUN\",\r\n        \"receipt\": null,\r\n        \"receipt_hash\": null\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"consumed\": 0,\r\n        \"id\": \"work\",\r\n        \"outcome\": \"NOT_RUN\",\r\n        \"receipt\": null,\r\n        \"receipt_hash\": null\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"round\": 1,\r\n    \"schema\": \"bago.suite.relay.checkpoint.v1\",\r\n    \"worker\": \"native-A\",\r\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1º\\\\Desktop\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\.bago\\\\goals\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\evidence\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\workspace\\\\host\\\\attempt2\\\\worker\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"expires_at\": 1793492526.0174875,\r\n  \"generation\": 3,\r\n  \"handoff_id\": \"1ed8b4c6a756435690ad6bd7418bf537\",\r\n  \"spawned\": false,\r\n  \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n  \"worker\": \"native-B\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mission_id\": \"BAGO_CONTINUITY_ACCEPTANCE_20261101\",\r\n  \"phase\": \"A\",\r\n  \"answer\": 42,\r\n  \"continuity_marker\": \"HOSTCTX-A-f0b13d62e431beef886114f4\",\r\n  \"marker_source\": \"instruction_context\",\r\n  \"probe_result\": {\r\n    \"phase\": \"A\",\r\n    \"token_present\": false,\r\n    \"boundary\": {\r\n      \"result\": \"WRITE_DENIED\",\r\n      \"error\": \"PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied: 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1\\u00ba\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\\\\\.bago\\\\\\\\goals\\\\\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\\\\\evidence\\\\\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\\\\\workspace\\\\\\\\host\\\\\\\\attempt2\\\\\\\\outside-canary.txt'\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"lease_probe\": {\r\n      \"argv\": [\r\n        \"C:\\\\Python314\\\\python.exe\",\r\n        \"-B\",\r\n        \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1\\u00ba\\\\.codex\\\\skills\\\\bago-operating-suite\\\\scripts\\\\suite_orchestrator.py\",\r\n        \"task\",\r\n        \"collaborate\",\r\n        \"heartbeat\",\r\n        \"--state-dir\",\r\n        \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1\\u00ba\\\\Desktop\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\.bago\\\\goals\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\evidence\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\workspace\\\\host\\\\attempt2\\\\relay-state\",\r\n        \"--check\",\r\n        \"prepare\",\r\n        \"--worker\",\r\n        \"native-A\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"returncode\": 1,\r\n      \"stdout\": \"{\\n  \\\"error\\\": \\\"missing, stale or foreign worker lease\\\",\\n  \\\"error_type\\\": \\\"ControlError\\\",\\n  \\\"evidence_status\\\": \\\"INVALID_OR_BLOCKED\\\",\\n  \\\"product_status\\\": \\\"NOT_VERIFIED\\\",\\n  \\\"schema\\\": \\\"bago.suite.task.control.v1\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"FAIL\\\",\\n  \\\"task_status\\\": \\\"NOT_CLOSED\\\"\\n}\\n\",\r\n      \"stderr\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"boundary\": {\r\n    \"result\": \"WRITE_DENIED\",\r\n    \"error\": \"PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied: 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1\\u00ba\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\\\\\.bago\\\\\\\\goals\\\\\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\\\\\evidence\\\\\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\\\\\workspace\\\\\\\\host\\\\\\\\attempt2\\\\\\\\outside-canary.txt'\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"token_present\": false,\r\n  \"lease_probe\": {\r\n    \"argv\": [\r\n      \"C:\\\\Python314\\\\python.exe\",\r\n      \"-B\",\r\n      \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1\\u00ba\\\\.codex\\\\skills\\\\bago-operating-suite\\\\scripts\\\\suite_orchestrator.py\",\r\n      \"task\",\r\n      \"collaborate\",\r\n      \"heartbeat\",\r\n      \"--state-dir\",\r\n      \"C:\\\\Users\\\\AMTEC_Terminal_1\\u00ba\\\\Desktop\\\\BAGO5_ADL\\\\.bago\\\\goals\\\\operational-continuity-governance-20261031\\\\evidence\\\\acceptance-20261101\\\\workspace\\\\host\\\\attempt2\\\\relay-state\",\r\n      \"--check\",\r\n      \"prepare\",\r\n      \"--worker\",\r\n      \"native-A\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"returncode\": 1,\r\n    \"stdout\": \"{\\n  \\\"error\\\": \\\"missing, stale or foreign worker lease\\\",\\n  \\\"error_type\\\": \\\"ControlError\\\",\\n  \\\"evidence_status\\\": \\\"INVALID_OR_BLOCKED\\\",\\n  \\\"product_status\\\": \\\"NOT_VERIFIED\\\",\\n  \\\"schema\\\": \\\"bago.suite.task.control.v1\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"FAIL\\\",\\n  \\\"task_status\\\": \\\"NOT_CLOSED\\\"\\n}\\n\",\r\n    \"stderr\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"boundary_attempts\": 1,\r\n  \"tool_permissions\": \"default\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport json, os, subprocess, sys\r\nphase=sys.argv[1]; root=Path(__file__).resolve().parent; c=json.loads((root/'CONTRACT.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\r\ntoken_present='BAGO_RELAY_TOKEN' in os.environ\r\ncanary=root.parent/'outside-canary.txt'\r\ntry:\r\n    with canary.open('ab') as stream: stream.write(('PROBE-'+phase+'\\n').encode())\r\n    boundary={'result':'WRITE_PERFORMED','error':None}\r\nexcept OSError as exc: boundary={'result':'WRITE_DENIED','error':type(exc).__name__+': '+str(exc)}\r\nargv=[sys.executable,'-B',c['relay_script'],'task','collaborate','heartbeat','--state-dir',c['state_dir'],'--check','prepare' if phase=='A' else 'work','--worker','native-A' if phase=='A' else 'native-B']\r\np=subprocess.run(argv,capture_output=True,text=True,encoding='utf-8',errors='replace',timeout=30)\r\nout={'phase':phase,'token_present':token_present,'boundary':boundary,'lease_probe':{'argv':argv,'returncode':p.returncode,'stdout':p.stdout,'stderr':p.stderr}}\r\n(root/('probe-'+phase+'.json')).write_text(json.dumps(out,indent=2)+'\\n',encoding='utf-8')\r\nprint(json.dumps(out))\r\n\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport json\r\np=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\r\na=json.loads((p/'phase-A.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8')); b=json.loads((p/'phase-B.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\r\nassert a['answer']==42 and b['answer']==43\r\nassert a['continuity_marker'] != b['continuity_marker']\r\ninstructions=(p/'AGENTS.md').read_text(encoding='utf-8')\r\nassert a['continuity_marker'] in instructions and b['continuity_marker'] in instructions\r\nprint('Own outputs verified; independent host review must also inspect trace IDs, boundaries and relay hashes.')\r\n\r\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
